window.products.push({"id":381047,"name":"1 Pc Break Apart Chocolate Mold Silicone Deep Candy Bar Molds Rectangle Shapes Snap Bar Silicone Molds for Wax Melts Large (A)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K3SZ4bODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RECTANGLE SHAPED SILICONE MOLDS - With nice rectangle shaped cavities and 1.5mm thick walls for good support, our silicone candy bar molds allow you to create amazing chocolates and snap bar wax melts! It's a nice presentation if you prepare those energy bar for gifts, or personalize snap bar wax melts as small business. The large chocolate bar molds are also great for gift baskets, giving your loved one or friends a sweet unforgettable baking memory HIGH-QUALITY BAKEWARE - Fimary's flexible thick chocolate candy bar molds silicone are BPA free, designed stronger, with more durable and thick premium materials that last longer than other break apart chocolate bar molds. Heat resistant from -40℉ to +446℉, these large silicone bar molds can be allowed for using in the freezer, oven and micro-wave, don't change shape or have odd smell afterwards. If you have any problem with our silicon chocolate candy molds, please contact us IDEAL SIZE OF TUCKING IN POCKET - Homemade thick candy bar can provide full energy you need to conquer everyday challenges, small size candy bar are perfect for on-the-go snacking. The rectangle chocolate molds silicone are 10x6.7x0.6 inch while the finished chocolate is 4.5x1.9x0.6 inch, deep enough to add a layer of nuts and fruits, small like your palm, very convenient to tuck in pocket, bag or backpack, so much easier to snack on, just snap off a rectangle whenever the craving hits! CLEANS IN SECONDS & DISHWASHER SAFE - People always get frustrated by cleaning cheap chocolate bar silicone molds for leftover residue. With nice sloped sides and non stick surface, our large silicone bar molds for baking are easy to demold, your chocolate will pop out easily with good detailed shape. After use, just simply put the deep chocolate bar molds into dishwasher, it comes out like new! If you don't use an automatic machine, cleaning it by hot soapy water is also a breeze MULTIPURPOSE - Break apart silicone molds for candy bars, chocolate bars, keto fat bombs and can even as wax melt molds, suitable for any festivals and occasions, such as Halloween, Christmas, new year, baby showers, birthday parties, etc. The deep chocolate molds silicone allows you to make sugar-free and low-carb foods for your kids and families, giving you a great healthy diet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K3SZ4bODL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fimary","source_asin":"B09VYYGM1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VYYGM1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VYYGM1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
