window.products.push({"id":381156,"name":"Rustic Wall Decor, Mini Farmhouse Wall Decor, Candle sconces with Mini Lanterns, Country Decor, Wall Decorations for Living Room, Bathroom,Wall sconce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZtxWA1XSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"RUSTIC CHARM TO YOUR HOME:These farmhouse wall decor are the perfect combination of modern and farmhouse styles, make the perfect touch of shabby chic to your home décor. creating a warm and romantic home atmosphere. Catch your full attention with a golden warm glow and display peace and harmony in your house through the Rustic Rustic Metal Lantern. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 2 Rustic Metal Lantern, 2 Wooden Shelves, 2 LED light Candles, 2 fairy string lights and 4spare CR2032 tab batteries. You can mix and match them however you want. Redefine your room by creating a cozy and warm atmosphere! Automatic On/Off function, more energy saving. Led candles are set to timing mode by default. On timer, it will automatically turn off after 6 hours. Also it will automatically turn on again 18 hours after turned off, which means it will turn on the same time next day. MULTI-SCENARIO PURPOSE: It's a perfect wall decor gift for your friends, lovers, anyone you want to give,. beautiful decoration for walls in living room, entrance, fireplace, kitchen, bedroom, hallway, wedding, party or anywhere in your home. Hang a Tea Light Holder in any space where you rest, relax, and enjoy the peace it creates for you. BEST SERVICE AND GUARANTEE : Each piece has it's own unique character. They may have small nicks, knot holes or scratches in the wood. All these features help give it a more rustic look and appearance. if for whatever reason you’re not satisfied, we got you covered! Our products are backed by 12-month warranty; you can return it to us for a refund or a replacement if there’s a problem","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZtxWA1XSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MANOKVENT","source_asin":"B0BM9T8YNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM9T8YNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM9T8YNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381157,"name":"RUCKUP Tactical Christmas Stocking with Molle Gear (Black-Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613FSjwY9nL._AC_SL1263_.jpg","description":"The Awesome Tactical Stocking by RUCKUP just got better. We embroider this stocking with the name or nick name or title of your choice for the ULTIMATE TACTICAL LOOK. The stocking can be embroidered on the VELCRO area on the top or on the SMALL PACKET FLAP in the middle of the stocking. IMPORTANT: TO GET YOUR STOCKING PERSONALIZED: Configure personalization on the Customize Now Button & ADD TO CART button will be on top of the Customize Now Pop Up Window. EMBROIDERY We offer personalization in embroidery - it looks best in the all capital letters, either white or grey color font and you can also choose other embroidery colors. You can choose to have it embroidered with name or nick name or rank or title or anything you like. EMBROIDERY LOCATION CHOICE: There is also choice of location for the personalization: The top has Loop Velcro meant for a patch, we offer to embroider the name there. No worries there is still plenty of space left so he can attach the patch under the embroidered name. You can also choose to have the embroidery on the POCKET FLAP instead, that's if he already has a patch and thus the pocket flap is perfect for personalization. If not preference given, we will embroider the name on the pocket flap. See additional images for closeout photos. The MOLLE is \"correct\" and works with accessories designed for it (it's also good for holding candy canes, bullets, knives). It has pocket on the front for holding small items that is perfectly sized for gift cards or wallet accessories; the main body unzips for easy access. It's made of matte-black no-rip nylon and is well-constructed. If you need assistance with customization checkout first and then look at your Amazon orders and click CONTACT SELLER button on the order you placed with us and enter personalizing info there into contact seller area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613FSjwY9nL._AC_SL1263_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUCKUP","source_asin":"B016FZTQVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016FZTQVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016FZTQVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
