window.products.push({"id":381225,"name":"Uniturcky Silver Silverware Set, 24-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set Service For 6, Mirror Polished Black Handle Tableware Cutlery Set Knife Fork An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ucMpwV4RS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"24 Piece Mirror Silverware Set Flatware is an important investment that enhances the dining experience. Our 304 stainless steel silverware set is ideal for 6 persons,modern style utility design,easy to match all your existing dinnerware or tableware. Picture yourself,nice sturdy mirror cutlery kitchen gadgets utensils set,meeting every dining ideal while never compromising on quality. All about Durability Our silverware are crafted from high quality 304 stainless steel,extra durability and rust resistance. Forks and spoons set,also knives. You’ll never have to worry about the knives struggling to cut,the spoons bending as you chow away,or the prongs of the forks curling out of shape like others do. You won’t regret taking this silverware set and serving food with them. Product Features -Complete silver ware set for full service,eating utensils service for 6. -Flat style of handle,ergonomic design,bringing a handle design for a modern look,chi and classic,unique elegant flatware set for 6. -Smooth edge without impurities,flat flatware is safety for your lip when you are eating food. Packing: Box Packaged -Dinner Knife x 6 (22cm/8.66'')(40g/1 pcs) -Dinner Fork x 6 (21.5cm/8.46'')(30g/1 pcs) -Dinner Spoon x 6 (21cm/8.26'')(40g/1 pcs) -Tea Spoon x 6 (13cm/5.11'')(10g/1 pcs) Using Instruction 1) Please wash the silverware sets with warm soapy water before first using. 2) Please clean and dry the dish ware after using,and stored in dry place for its durability. 3) Please do not use any harsh detergents,steel wool,scouring pads or sharp objects to avoid silverware scratches. Customer Service: If you have any questions with our stainless silverware set,just feel free to contact us,thanks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ucMpwV4RS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uniturcky","source_asin":"B0928PS9CN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928PS9CN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928PS9CN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381226,"name":"10 PK Nonstick Teflon Reusable Stove Burner Covers, gas range protector Liners mat for electric stoves top 6 Pk, Silicone Counter Gap Cover 2 Pk +Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rt4VcgYkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reusable stove Cover protector 6 pck+ 2 Oven liner 2 Pack,+ silicone Gap liner 2 Pack: Pragmatic household accessories to keep your stove your oven from the oil and pasta water, crumble from baking overflow to the surface. The stove burner covers black color can easily cover the mess and oil and water that already on the stove surface. With this gas stove burner liners, you will love your kitchen again with no mess. And make your stovetop fresh like a new one! Pre-cut. CAN BE CUT: The hole of stovetop covers and oven liner could be trimmed with scissors to fit your gas stove properly before use. <6> Package includes: 6 Pack gas stove burner covers black, one per size 10.6in x 10.6in, thickness 0.2mm. and 2 Pack oven liner 16.5 inc x 20.5 inc x thickness 0.2mm. clean quickly and easily: Made of 100% food-grade silicone.  INSTALLATION STOVE COVER: Important Note - Please cut the hole of covers at least 0.5 inches away from the flame on the highest setting.  CLEANING YOUR VALUE PACK : Easy to clean - Dishwasher washable Wipe the stove cover/ Over Liner with soapy water after cooling Cook it your way - Do not need to waste your time to scrub the stovetop as warm soapy water with a cloth will do the trick for you Please Clean Silicon Gap cover with a warm damp cloth. INSTALLATION AS ILLUSTRATED IN THE PICTURE Step 1 Measuring the size precisely and mark by a pen Step 2 Use scissors to customize the size based on the mark Step 3 Taking off the stove accessories and laying the cover Step 4 Reassembling the stove accessories. SILICONE GAP COVER: Clean Surface of intended use, and allow to dry for proper installation. Apply narrow end in between the Gap. OVEN LINER Use as desire; clean like the Stover Liner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rt4VcgYkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MADAJ","source_asin":"B0827H436C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0827H436C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0827H436C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
