window.products.push({"id":381336,"name":"Handcrafted 100% Pure Copper Mugs|Solid Copper Mugs 16 oz| Copper Cups for Moscow Mule copper mug (ST. Plain-1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8168GBUhdpL._AC_SL1069_.jpg","description":"Pure Copper Mugs will keep your favorite beverage cool and refreshing. The copper transmits the cold to the hand and lips better than any glass could, amplifying the bright mix of ginger and lime. Used for vodka, tequila, whiskey, beer, rum, ice tea, lemonade, iced coffee, maintain the cool temperature of the drink better than other materials. - Directions To Get The Long Term Use From Your Moscow Mule Mugs : After each use, hand wash and dry immediately with soft cloth. Real copper oxidizes with time and creates a patina. To keep the exterior looking new, use a copper polish or a combination of lemon and salt. To Avoid the Black Spots you have to clean regularly with The Copper Cleaner Powder . Please Don't Use Lemon or Soda to Clean the Copper . It Will be damage the Copper Item Permanently if you will Use Lemon or Soda to Clean the Copper. \" Occasionally use a non-abrasive cleaner to keep your copperware look new. Rub briskly with a soft cotton cloth using a copper polish. Do not leave your drink in mug overnight to avoid stains. You should not use these mugs in a microwave. These mugs are intended for cold beverages. The mugs are not insulated. Important Tips: * The pure copper finish can be scratched if washed with harsh detergents or in most dishwashers. * Do not clean with any abrasive detergents or cloths. * A half of lemon dipped in a bit of salt will polish your copper Moscow mule mugs up in no time and return them to their original splendor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8168GBUhdpL._AC_SL1069_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"US Shopee","source_asin":"B01GB07CSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GB07CSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GB07CSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
