window.products.push({"id":381362,"name":"Airluck Feather Down Comforter Twin Size Duvet Insert Hotel Fluffy Down Blanket Grey 68x90 inches Winter Warmth 45oz Soft Down Proof Cotton Poly Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611UXOq2MvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Winter Comforter: The heavy weight Twin size down comforter is 68 x 90 inches and 45 oz fill weight, provides ultimate warmth. Ideal for cold climates & winter sleeping. Four size choice for your choose:California king 108\"x 98\",King size 106\" x 90\", Queen size 90\" x 90\" and Twin size 68\" x 90\". Premium Material: The duvet filling with 80% grayduck feather and 20% down. The premium filling have all passed the RDS,OEKO-TEX Certification,fluffy and odorless. So please be confident to use it. With the box construction, the down could be evenly distributed in its proper place and keeps the down from shifting. So you always have a plush, fluffy comforter that retains its shape; Clean crisp look complements any room decor or style. Ultra-Soft Fabric: High density 600 thread count white cotton-poly blend cover shell, Ultra soft, natural, plush, breathable and no static, providing you a noiseless and super cosy night sleep. The white down comforter have 4 Corner tabs and 4 side Loops,which is very convenient for attaching a duvet cover and anchor the down comforter from shifting. All our comforters feature double-needle stitching to enhance their durability and prevent the down from sneaking. Use Tips：The Airluck down comforter cames with vacuum pack, please fluffy it up gently and wait a few hours for it back to original lofty. we highly recommend Dry Clean or Professionally Launder. Machine wash in cold. Gentle cycle separately with extra free movement in the washer or dryer necessarily if needed. Customers can choose from two versions depending on their temperature preferences and current location. Three neutral colors for the shell are also available. The Heavyweight feather Down Comforter is a standout pick for anyone who wants more insulation, as well as those who reside in more temperate climates that become significantly colder in the fall and winter months. If you're a hot sleeper or transitioning into the warmer months, we recommend trying the Airluck's all season version.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611UXOq2MvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airluck","source_asin":"B0B8SKFNQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8SKFNQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8SKFNQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
