window.products.push({"id":381503,"name":"Homeries 2 Tier Wall Spice Rack For Kitchens | Stylish Wall Mounted Spices And Seasonings Storage Rack | Organize Your Home, Eliminate Clutter & Add S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sSvRTd7qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Most people have their spices tucked away in the pantry. Out of sight, out of mind right? Sure, but when you need one, finding the spice you need can be a real nightmare. It’s like trying to find a needle in a haystack! Plus, all of those small spice bottles take up a ton of space! There’s a better, more efficient way to store all of your spices and seasonings, and that is with this hanging spice rack. You’ll be able to get the spices you need with ease and create a lot more room in your cabinets or pantry. It’s also a great addition to a bathroom. You can hang it up and store things like nail polish, meds, cosmetics, toiletries, and so much more. This storage rack truly is a must-have for every home. It measures 9.5 x 1.5/8 x 12 inches, so it will comfortably fit on most walls. You’ll love the style too. It will fit in with nearly any interior design… farmhouse, rustic, country, minimalism, shabby chic, you name it. It also makes a great gift idea. Everybody could use more storage in their home or apartment, and this rack certainly provides that! We designed it to be very easy to hang. All of the mounting hardware comes included. You won’t need to call a handyman or purchase any special tools either. You’ll have this spice rack beautifully hung up in no time. The durable steel we used to make it ensures that it will last you a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sSvRTd7qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homeries","source_asin":"B09DMHRS6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DMHRS6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DMHRS6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
