window.products.push({"id":381537,"name":"LIFERECORD Futon Sofa Bed Modern Faux Leather Convertible Sofa Memory Foam Daybed with Adjustable Armrests for Living Room Apartment Dorm, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910yduxErWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Modern Futon Sofa】 Featuring a split backrest and tapered legs, this futon showcases a clean silhouette to the fullest, making it perfect for adding a modern flair to any living ensemble. The split-back design of this futon sofa can be easily adjusted to any of your activities, from time for a friendly chat, reading or watching TV to a quick nap or a good night's sleep. 【Adjustable Armrests】The armrests of the sofa bed have four adjustable positions, can be raised up as armrests, pillows or footrests, or can be laid flat to accommodate more people. This futon bed frame is made of solid wood, with 6 chrome metal legs to ensure that it is still strong and durable in your long-term use. Max. load capacity: 600 lbs. 【Ideal For Small Spaces】 Perfect for unexpected overnight guests, or just a convenient nap spot, this is a versatile solution for small spaces in apartments, studios, and homes. Sofa size: 70.5\"L x 33\"W x 29\"H. When used as a bed: 70.5 \"L x 41.5 \"W x 15 \"H. 【Comfortable Futon Sofa Bed】 The cushion has been thickened, and it is filled with a high-density sponge, so it has great resilience and is very comfortable to sit on. The brown color sofa is made of artificial PU leather, which has excellent elasticity and toughness. What's more, the coil spring is evenly stressed, not easy to deform, and can last for a long time. 【Easy to Assemble】Amazingly, in less than 20 minutes, the simple assembly of unboxing and room placement can be done, with no expert assembly required. Start enjoying this convertible sleeper sofa for your everyday comfort. If you have any quality problems, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910yduxErWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFERECORD","source_asin":"B0BQJ9NL49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQJ9NL49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQJ9NL49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381538,"name":"Hampton Nautical Wooden Vintage Yellow Lobster Trap Buoy, 7\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21K2DsbznTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Classically themed and delightfully decorative, our Wooden Vintage Yellow Maine Lobster Trap Buoy 7\" can be used to hang on the wall or as a beach theme Christmas ornament. This whitewash and yellow wooden float is the perfect beach decor accent to your home or collection. Traditionally lobstermen would hand paint their own unique buoy to distinguish theirs amongst the many lobster trap buoys at sea. In upholding the spirit of the lobster buoy tradition, we offer a new or rustic finish, sizes of 7\", 8\", 15\" and 20\" and finally a range of colors such as: dark blue, orange, red, dark red, green, dark green, light blue and yellow. Handcrafted Nautical Decor is the premier manufacturer of the world's finest model boats, nautical decorations and tropical & beach decor. Whether you are looking for stunningly accurate models of historical ships like the Titanic or Blackbeard's pirate ship, or you're looking for nautical replicas, gifts and decor such as compasses, world globes, porthole mirrors, model sailboats, ships in a bottle, or brass spyglass & telescopes, Handcrafted Nautical Decor provides the highest quality expertly handcrafted nautical gifts at wholesale prices. Their extensive product line of model ships, nautical decorations & gifts includes trendy tropical, sailing and beach decor, as well as supplies and decor for your home or nautical-themed party. Handcrafted Nautical Decor products are designed by master artisans and crafted from the finest materials available; their fully assembled model ships and decorative items make great gifts for all ages and will be a stunning addition to your home or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21K2DsbznTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handcrafted Nautical Decor","source_asin":"B00IPLOQUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IPLOQUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IPLOQUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381539,"name":"RV Camper 400 Thread Count 100% Long Staple Soft Cotton Sheet Set, 4 Piece Set,Short Queen 60\"X75\"SHEETS, 12\"Deep Pocket, Smooth & Soft Sateen Weave, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lE28oNmgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Package: The RV Camper 4 Pcs sheet set package Includes 1 Fitted bottom sheet of dimension 60\"X75\" Inch with 12 inch Drop + 1 Flat top sheet of dimension 90\"X102\" inch and 2 Pillowcases of dimension 20\" X 30\" inch . Ideal For: The Sheet set ensures the super comfort and pleasant glow which makes it an ideal choice to make your bedding luxurious, 5- star hotel like bedding experience, a gift to your close one or for your children’s beds. These sheet sets are best for RV Camper - bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV , vacation home. Perfect gifting idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, and to your dear ones. Fabric: The Sheet Set are made up of 100% Cotton. The Fabric is 400 thread count means per square inch of fabric, the total thread counts are 400. More the thread counts are more you feel soft and comfortable. The 400 TC high-quality cotton will let you experience the best quality and comfortable sleep. Wash Care: The Sheet Set is 400 TC superfine cotton so it demands very less care compared to other low-grade sheet set. However, for experiencing the product at its best, we recommend gentle machine wash in old water before use and do not bleach. Tumble Dry Low If Needed and wash dark colours separately preferably use laundry mesh washing bags. Product Satisfaction: We believe in customer satisfaction and we assure you with the excellent product quality and customer service. However, if not happy with the purchase or have any query, feel free to contact us anytime. Even after the return policy of Amazon, if you are not satisfied with the product, come to us. We gladly will help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lE28oNmgL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mattress-Homes","source_asin":"B08KS5QGF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KS5QGF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KS5QGF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381540,"name":"You Got This Blanket Throw Gift Filled with Uplifting Quotes of Encouragement Inspiration Motivation Reassurance Positivity Optimism Gray 60 x 50 Sher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5189xxCNc0L._AC_.jpg","description":"WRAP YOUR FRIENDS AND LOVED ONES WITH THE COZIEST THOUGHTFUL THROW BLANKET ON THE MARKET! ACCEPTOURTHANKS would like to be the first to say “THANK YOU!” Our products focus on quality and positivity.  Together, we hope to manufacture PERFECT GIFTS for specific occasions. Do you know a person who is crisis, struggling with a dilemma or maybe feeling depressed? You’ve come to the right place! Lift their spirits with ultra-soft and comfy throw blanket full of positive motivational quotes to encourage, uplift and inspire. This thoughtful gift will be useful for years to come and forever show your reassurance and confidence. Made with love, our throw blanket is lined with Sherpa for warmth and comfort. Our throw blankets do NOT shed and are machine washable. Deliver comfort and caring thoughts with this unique gift. ACCEPTOURTHANKS “You Got This” Blanket Quotes:  Yesterday is heavy. Put it down. You may have to fight a battle more than once Difficult roads always lead to beautiful destinations YOU NEVER LOSE.  YOU EITHER WIN OR YOU LEARN.  When it rains, look for rainbows. When it’s dark, look for stars. NO ESCAPES THE WILDERNESS ON THE WAY TO THE PROMISED LAND YOU CAN’T GO BACK AND CHANGE THE BEGINNING BUT  YOU CAN START WHERE YOU ARE AND CHANGE THE ENDING YOU GOT THIS! DON’T LET YESTERDAY HURT YOU TODAY MAY EVERY SUNRISE HOLD MORE PROMISE AND EVERY SUNSET HOLD MORE PEACE Making progress doesn’t mean moving quickly toward success;  at times, you’ll have to squint to see it… keep going THE BEST WAY TO PREDICT THE FUTURE IS TO CREATE IT Nothing ever goes away until it TEACHES us what we need to KNOW At the end of the day, you can ENDURE much more than you think you can","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5189xxCNc0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accept Our Thanks","source_asin":"B08YXCKJ78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YXCKJ78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YXCKJ78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
