window.products.push({"id":381657,"name":"12 Pieces Hanging Shamrocks Ornament Ball 2in Green Shamrocks Plastic Ball Ornament Good Luck Clover Hat Balls Decor Baubles with Hanging Rope for Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813hB756sbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☘️☘️ABUNDANT QUANTITY: Package includes totally 12 pieces of St. Patrick's Day ball ornaments in 3 different styles, 4 pieces of each style, abundant quantity and adorable multiple styles could meet your various needs for St. Patrick's Day decorations. ☘️☘️PREMIUM MATERIAL: These adorable hanging ornaments are made of premium plastic, which is light in weight, compact in size, strong in texture and bright in colors, easy to hang on the trees or any other places. The hollow plastic balls are sprayed with colorful powder, not easy to break, deform or fade, which guarantee a long time repeated use. ☘️☘️CONVENIENT TO HANG: Each of our plastic good luck decorations has been equipped with a hanging loop and rope, which allows you to hang them anywhere you want to decorate without effort, such as tree, window, door, ceiling, fireplace and more, considerate design would make your decoration process more easily and efficiently. ☘️☘️PRETTY ST PATRICK ORNAMENTS: These clover hat decorations baubles are designed in a simple and classic style, which would not be out-of-date easily, you could mix and match them into various combinations and use them to decorate your house and parties on St. Patrick's Day! ☘️☘️APPLY FOR WIDE OCCASIONS: These St. Patrick balls ornaments are tailored specifically for St Patrick's day! Beautiful decorations for home, office, and outdoor, to bring you a strong festive atmosphere. Perfect for St. Patrick’s day party decorations, and also as a good St. Patrick’s day gift for your friend and family, together with enjoying the Irish St. Patrick's day festival! ☘️☘️MULTIPLE CHARMING STYLES: These St. Patrick's Day balls decorations are designed with 3 different styles - Gold balls with green shamrocks, Silver balls with green shamrocks and hats, Silver balls with green HAPPY ST. PATS letters, these patterns all adopt shamrocks as main patterns with St. Patrick’s style design. Hanging them in your house at this St. Patrick’s Day, would bring you and your guests a pleasant mood. ☘️☘️BEAUTIFUL MORAL FOR YOU: Shamrocks/clovers are said to symbolize good luck, love and hope. The first leaf represents true love, the second leaf represents health, and the third leaf represents reputation. Hope these lovely shamrocks balls decoration with winsome appearance could bring you a good luck! ☘️☘️INSTRUCTIONS: Each green shamrock measures about 1.4 inch in diameter; St. Patrick's day ornaments ball measures about 2.4 inch in diameter. Due to long-term transportation, some decorative top caps will fall off but don’t worry, you can install them any time, and then you can use our St. Patrick's day decorations for home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813hB756sbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kuscul","source_asin":"B09NR5QL6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NR5QL6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NR5QL6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
