window.products.push({"id":381670,"name":"XelNaga Brew Bags Reusable 2 PCS, Extra Large 26inchx22inch Fine Mesh Strainer Bag Home Brewing Hops Grains Fruit Cider Apple Grape Wine Beer Making P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715W5ig4ZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brewing can't be more easier and time-saving. Brew in a Bag (BIAB) is a preferred method for all grain and partial mash brewing, it continues to grow in popularity as a cheaper and simplified brewing way, it leads to shorter setup and cleanup times, just requires the necessary basics and the bag, no additional equipment. It saves time, space and money,and it can be reused for many batches of homebrew! Especially designed for home brewers!  1-Large size(22\" X 26\"): Suitable for 5-10 gallon kettles, holds up to 20lbs of grain. 2-The safty temperature: -40℉-248℉ (-40℃-120℃). 3-250 micron mesh ensure no grains slip into the wort when use. 4-Come with adjustable lock. Keep the bag tight, prevent falling and spilling. 5-Made of fine durable polyester. Easy to clean. 6-Reinforced stitch edge enable the brew bags to be repeated use.  Small Tips: -When you use it before the first time, please rinse the bag in warm water. -Please turn the bag inside out and you can machine wash or hand wash it , rinse and let them dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715W5ig4ZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XelNaga","source_asin":"B09QWQG6CW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QWQG6CW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QWQG6CW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
