window.products.push({"id":381879,"name":"Convenience Concepts Tucson Nesting End Tables, Cherry / Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JzZeSVUPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Tucson Collection from Convenience Concepts brings function and style to every home. This transitional assortment is built to last with its powder coated metal X-frame beautifully welded together. With gorgeous sleek lines and an open concept feel, this collection offers a fresh, clean look to spruce up your home. The Tucson furniture assortment offers a wide variety of furniture from end tables to bookcases, console tables and so much more. This fun set looks and feels so sophisticated and timeless. Beyond the styling, the Tucson was built to accommodate your daily lifestyle with plenty of usable storage space. Complete your home today with Convenience Concepts Tucson Collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JzZeSVUPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Convenience Concepts","source_asin":"B086HL3K6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HL3K6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HL3K6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381880,"name":"Hog Wild Peeramid Reading Pillow, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61unmTxBFRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Hog Wild was founded in 1996 and we live by these simple rules: We sell innovative novelty products typically geared to older kids (over 8) and that cross over to adults. We try to be different and dance to our own beat when developing toys and gifts. We avoid competition whenever possible (no board games, no fashion dolls, no flying disks). We don't do gag gifts but do enjoy humor and farting products (we just don't sell them). We're not the brightest bulbs in the warehouse but we do try and often own up to our stupid mistakes. We like things simple because it's easier for us to understand. We're located in Porkland, Oregon and ship all our products from this sometimes inconvenient location. We typically take 3 to 5 days to process an order for our retail stores and we like to get paid on time. If you're a credit worthy retailer, we'll offer you terms. If you're an \"end user\" we want you to buy from our website and we value you the most of all. I'm sorry our prices are not dirt cheap but what you find from us, you should not find anywhere else. There are times when we get knocked off but that's life in the toy business. We're always on the prowl for new ideas and look to outside inventors for help. Most of the really good inventors are very hard to find and they are often bar tenders, school teachers, fireman, and other professions not typically associated with inventing. When we find these people, they typically have really clever, never before seen ideas. They are always smarter than we are and we feel very lucky when they license their product idea to us. Fact: The best products we have always come from outside inventors. If you've got a great idea, we'd love to hear from you. If you work at a professional inventing company with fancy presentations and 1,000s of great ideas, you're probably not a great fit for us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61unmTxBFRL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hog Wild","source_asin":"B00B8ZHYGE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B8ZHYGE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B8ZHYGE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381881,"name":"Homedics Perfectsteam Deluxe Handheld Garment Steamer (Black, 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OGhlBFKpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"It just got a lot easier to look your best every day. The Perfect Steam Deluxe Handheld Garment Steamer from HoMedics heats up incredibly fast — just 40 seconds to get its powerful continuous steam going. It features a stainless steel soleplate that glides smoothly across your garments; or, switch from normal mode into Turbo mode to swiftly handle your toughest wrinkles. The Perfect Steam even features a built-in creaser, to give any item that ultra-professional look. Its 8.7-oz water tank provides up to 15 minutes of continuous steam, to take care of your whole day’s wardrobe. Plus, it’s safe for all fabrics, and includes a 2-in-1 cushion and bristle brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OGhlBFKpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homedics","source_asin":"B08BLWBMG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLWBMG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLWBMG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
