window.products.push({"id":381892,"name":"Creative Co-Op Hand-Carved Engraved Mango Wood Square Trivets for Dining Table Coaster, Set of 4, White & Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gp81n5uqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enhance the style and appeal of your dining area as you add the set of hand-carved coasters that create a farmhouse setting in your interiors. The engraved design makes them a sample of artistic finesse and makes these heat protectant kitchen essentials a must-have in your kitchen. Besides posing a protective barrier between the hot dishes and your furniture's surfaces, it further adds elegance and style to your dining table, posing as a dining table centerpiece. Created with mango wood and marble, these coasters offer durability, and apart from being a decorative accent, these will be an excellent gift for a housewarming party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gp81n5uqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Co-Op","source_asin":"B09B4J7NGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B4J7NGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B4J7NGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381893,"name":"30 Ringworm Bush or Candelabra Bush Herbal Seeds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21SxyHSptBL._AC_.jpg","description":"30 Ringworm Bush or Candelabra Bush Herbal Seeds the Candle Bush, is an important medicinal tree as well as an ornamental flowering plants The shrub stands 3–4 m tall, with leaves 50–80 cm long. The inflorescence looks like a yellow candle. often called the Ringworm Bush because of its very effective fungicidal properties, for treating ringworm and other fungal infections of the skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21SxyHSptBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SeedSeeds","source_asin":"B00JPJHTGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JPJHTGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JPJHTGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381894,"name":"Duralex Made in France Prisme Marine Glass Tumbler Drinking Glasses, 8.75 ounce - Set of 6, Marine Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PX41K86EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Founded in 1939, Duralex has been manufacturing tempered glassware and tabletop products for over 80 years in La Chappelle-Saint-Mesmin in the very heart of France. Since 1939, when Duralex invented the glass tempering process, the name Duralex has been associated with toughened glassware, utilizing their proprietary process. The original tempered (toughened) Picardie glasses are still produced in France and are known as the \"original French tumblers\". The Picardie glass is functional yet stylish and feels extremely comfortable in the hand. The tempered glasses are equally suitable for cold or hot drinks, conveniently stackable, microwave, freezer and dishwasher-safe, impact and chip resistant, and the perfect weight. With the help of continuous investments and commitment to quality, Duralex has reached a level of excellence that makes its products recognized throughout the world. Duralex is and will always remain a true French manufacturer of glassware and tabletop products, and is the only glass manufacturer that makes 100% of their products in France. Picardie Marine- Glasses known as the \"original French tumblers\", the tempered Picardie glasses are functional and stylish - they feel extremely comfortable in your hand. Named after the Picardie province in northern France, this region is the heartland of French gothic cathedrals. The Picardie tempered glasses are suitable for hot or cold drinks and conveniently stackable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PX41K86EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duralex","source_asin":"B074411Z7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381894","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074411Z7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074411Z7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381895,"name":"Hananona 50 Pcs Artificial Pine Branches Green Plants Pine Needles DIY Accessories for Garland Wreath Christmas and Home Garden Decor (50, Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LkXw+EchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ARTIFICIAL PINE BRANCHES: These artificial pine branches bring you the feeling of fresh and elegant, they are beautiful and realistic. Brighten your home with this artificial pine branches. They can work harmoniously with any decor and style. REALISTIC: This life size artificial pine branches will always look fresh and full of life just like the real thing. It will always be fresh with no rotting and needs no maintenance. MATERIAL: The life of a real artificial pine branches is short. Why not chose an alternative one. The artificial pine branches are made of plastic, durable for years and remain vivid. The stem is internally wired, flexible and easy for flower arrangement. QUANTITY AND SIZE: Package include 50 pieces artificial pine branches. (Vase not include). The artificial pine branches measures about 9.85”(25cm) in length. VERSATILE: Artificial pine branches is a perfect decoration for in indoor, outdoor and Christmas decoration. It can be a wonderful centerpiece by simply put them in a jar or vase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LkXw+EchL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hananona","source_asin":"B0B82NK87J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B82NK87J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B82NK87J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
