window.products.push({"id":381909,"name":"Chicology Adjustable Sliding Panels, Cut to Length Vertical Blinds, Gainsboro (Blackout) - Up to 80\"W X 96\"H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SU4Mo202L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chicology Adjustable Sliding Panels are optimal for bringing modern style and elegance into any home. Highly versatile, they are perfect for everything from patio and French doors to room dividers and closet doors. Available in a variety of natural woven materials and fabrics, they are stylish, cost effective solutions. Pick a material rich in texture to inspire a feeling of exploration or opt for a smooth fabric perfect for a minimalist design. They are modern day answer to vertical blinds, with wider fabric panels, free of clacking sounds. Designed with the customer in mind, we made installation a breeze. Included in the packing is all the hardware for ceiling and wall installation, and inside and outside frame mounts. The telescopic track is adjustable anywhere from 44 to 80-inches wide . For wider needs, two tracks can be installed next to each other for a seamless appearance. Each of the four panels are 22-inches wide and 96 inches tall. Simply trim the panel height to what you need and install the bottom rails for a custom-look finish. Built cordless with a smooth track, these panels can open from right to left, left to right, and right down the center. Our cordless panels are safe for young children and pets. Measurement: Customizable Size This product is adjustable in both Width and Height. Width is adjustable from 44\" to 80\". Height is trimmable up to a maximum of 96\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SU4Mo202L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICOLOGY","source_asin":"B06W9M6C1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W9M6C1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W9M6C1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381910,"name":"Sonax Cyprus 60-Inch TV/Component Bench with Sliding Glass Doors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813kBRDFYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cyprus Collection brings the Ebony Pecan faux wood to life in your living space. Catering to diverse design styles this unique television bench has ample storage room for all components and two sliding tinted glass cabinet fronts. The CY-8668 has the perfect combination of closed and open storage for any interior. This TV Bench accommodates most HD TV’s up to 72”. Bring home this contemporary furniture by Sonax, proudly built in North America.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813kBRDFYQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sonax","source_asin":"B003D3OH82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003D3OH82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003D3OH82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381911,"name":"Pure Organic Cotton Blush Percale Weave Bed Sheet Set, 3 Piece Twin Size Sheets, Moisture Wicking, Lightweight, Crisp Cool, GOTS Certified, Fits Mattr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z8Bli2bOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Percale with Subtle softness: Wrap yourself in these Organic Cotton sheets that are truly worthy of an elegant bed room, it gives comfort like world class hotel suits. Crisp Cool Comfortable, best quality & opulence set our sheet set in a class above the rest. Beautifully elegant yet durable, their softness gets enhanced with each washing. Bring this luxury to your bedroom & enjoy the comfort of Organic cotton sheets at a modest price. The set is available in Twin, Full, Queen, King, Twin XL. TWIN SIZE Organic Cotton 3pc Bed Sheets Set - 1 Flat Sheet: 66\" W x 96\" L; 1 Fully Elasticized all around Fitted Sheet: 39\" W x 75\" L + 14\" finished deep pocket to fit mattress up to 16\"; and 1 Standard Pillowcase: 20\" W x 30\" L. Our Deep Pocket fitted sheet feature Smart Head/Foot Tag to indicate the width side of the bottom fitted sheet for ease of use. Regular wash for superior softness is recommended. LUXURY SHEET SET: Enjoy the richness of this GOTS Certified Organic Cotton Sheet Set for your entire family. Organic cotton is the purest form of cotton produced while adhering to internationally accepted standards. Unlike conventional cotton bed sheets, organic cotton bed linen contains no toxins which may harm your skin. In fact, if you have a toddler at home, trust organic cotton sheets to give your child a healthy sleep every night. Explore it right away! CERTIFICATION: Made in a vertically integrated factory certified for OEKO-TEX, STeP-Certificate(Made in Green), OHSAS-18001, BSCI, ISO-14001, ISO-9001, LEED Certificate from US Green Council etc. We believe in delivering nothing less than the best quality for our customers. GOTS Certification is recognized as the world’s leading textile processing standard for textiles made from organic fibers and our products are GOTS Certified. YOUR TRUST - OUR ASSURANCE: Each piece is individually inspected for defect free product. A class of Elegant rich quality Organic Cotton Sheet Set which can be used for the Master Bedroom, Charming Guest room, Hotel Suite Room and even Hospital Room; Available at a very reasonable price. Machine wash, Do not bleach, Do not dry clean, Tumble dry normal, Iron medium, Dry in shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z8Bli2bOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Purity Home","source_asin":"B08MKRMGCF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MKRMGCF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MKRMGCF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
