window.products.push({"id":381919,"name":"Milliard Electric Non Stick 12 Inch Crepe Maker/Griddle Comes with Batter Spreader and Wooden Spatula for Easy No Scratch Flipping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hGuuVHHKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This automatic hands free Electric jar opener allows you to easily open even the toughest jar lids. Simply set it down on the lid, press the button and watch it effortlessly unscrew the lid the super-strong Vice of the jar opener twist locks on tight to the lid of any jar and unscrews it with ease. Features: Adjusts to fit different jar sizes and always has a firm grip around lids easy to use position it on the lid, press the easy-switch button, and watch it rotate and uncap. You don't even have to hold on to the opener- it rotates around automatically perfect for seniors, kids, or arthritis suffers. Specification: Color: White Lid width range: 1-inch to 4-inch Weight: 0.8 lbs Size: 7.2 inches long Battery: 2X AA (not included) Material: plastic Condition: 100% brand new Package includes: 1X automatic jar opener 1Xmanual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hGuuVHHKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"instecho","source_asin":"B00MWAXMJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MWAXMJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MWAXMJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":381920,"name":"Vacuum Sealer Machine, Bonsenkitchen Food Vacuum Sealer Machine With Air Sealing System with 3 Food Modes, Food Vacuum Sealer for Food Preservation wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71havKPbtuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Seal Freshness and Save More Money】: Our food vacuum sealer machine can preserve food up to 6 times longer than zipper bags or containers. The food vacuum sealer provides 3 different food modes, allowing you to store different food according their types. Our vacuum sealer will protect food from freezer burn and effectively extend food freshness to reduces spoilage and food waste. 【3 Food Modes】 Our vacuum sealer kit have strong 60Kpa vacuum power and 3 food sealing modes. Choose the dry mode for solid foods like cookies, nuts, candies and other dry foods. Moist mode is for foods like meat, seafood poached and other simmered or steamed food. Gentle mode is for vacuum sealer water-free and fragile food. 【Easy to Operate】Our vacuum sealer machine are designed with manual food vacuum sealer machine. When sealing the vacuum bag, press the cutter firmly from both sides (left or right sides) and slide to the other end. NOTE: Do not slide from the middle to both sides. Soft touch digital buttons, LED indicator lights, electric plug in and the control center placed on the top panel. It's very easy to use and friendly to new users. 【Separated Design】The upper lid of the vacuum sealer machine is removable so you can clean the vacuum food sealer more easily and safely. It is recommended that you clean the food vacuum sealer after use because bacteria can build up easily. With proper care, it will serve longer for you. 【Compact and Lightweight】With its compact and sleek look, the bonsenkitchen vacuum sealer does not take up a lot of space in the kitchen. It is very small and fairly light which does not need much space for storage. Its compact size and lightweight design makes the portable vacuum sealer easy to store and move around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71havKPbtuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonsenkitchen","source_asin":"B09DK9CHC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-381920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DK9CHC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DK9CHC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
